                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To make resistant to damage from fire."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "36d67a9a-9184-4997-9f58-a22af085d05b",
                                                "sense_id": "9a69ba80-b7ea-302d-91d6-59f951b7c86d",
                                                "text": "I hastily fireproofed my clothing somewhat by pouring a bucket of water over myself before dashing into the flames."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6ad020c6-67fe-463c-bfbe-5e1b014e2e13",
                        "source_entry_id": "a272e117-ff07-3184-8270-626d9a117e62",
                        "source_sense_id": "8ecc2f25-c677-3575-a81a-fa3f3dca4cf4",
                        "target_lang_word": "refractory",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "refractory",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "844aece0-5a41-3a4a-940e-62780309271b",
                                        "entry_id": "533dad95-3bd0-37ac-8d11-88207c0f1e2c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Obstinate and unruly; strongly opposed to something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "35a5ec18-a374-4762-8115-38274fa23474",
                                                "sense_id": "844aece0-5a41-3a4a-940e-62780309271b",
                                                "text": "[…] in most instances attempts to coerce the refractory and disobedient have been the signals of bloody wars, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fbbeb308-9b96-449b-8c9c-d9aa7b3633df",
                                                "sense_id": "844aece0-5a41-3a4a-940e-62780309271b",
                                                "text": "Mr. Weller knocked at the door, and after a pretty long interval—occupied by the party without, in whistling a tune, and by the party within, in persuading a refractory flat candle to allow itself to be lighted […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6479a508-3061-4bd7-9f2d-bb2f2415a3a9",
                                                "sense_id": "844aece0-5a41-3a4a-940e-62780309271b",
                                                "text": "For five minutes Pollyanna worked swiftly, deftly, combing a refractory curl into fluffiness, perking up a drooping ruffle at the neck, or shaking a pillow into plumpness so that the head might have a better pose. Meanwhile the sick woman, frowning prodigiously, and openly scoffing at the whole procedure, was, in spite of herself, beginning to tingle with a feeling perilously near to excitement."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d197fda7-81ee-37e2-9508-b2f8e6493aeb",
                                        "entry_id": "533dad95-3bd0-37ac-8d11-88207c0f1e2c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not affected by great heat."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "57677023-621b-47e1-aa2f-e187d844e41e",
                                                "sense_id": "d197fda7-81ee-37e2-9508-b2f8e6493aeb",
                                                "text": "Pure lime is extremely refractory, but readily fusible if any silex is brought in contact with it; […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "662ef9a2-3c69-3780-973f-61fc83274533",
                                        "entry_id": "533dad95-3bd0-37ac-8d11-88207c0f1e2c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Resistant to treatment; not responding adequately to therapy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f0dd4bef-7dae-4bc1-b428-e580ae8cea9c",
                                                "sense_id": "662ef9a2-3c69-3780-973f-61fc83274533",
                                                "text": "Many of the vague and refractory cases of neck and shoulder pain and of migraine may be due to cervical disc disease."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "57bc18aa-fa67-4cb8-ba4a-addc6a1fb9e8",
                                                "sense_id": "662ef9a2-3c69-3780-973f-61fc83274533",
                                                "text": "In 33 adult patients with long standing refractory epilepsy on treatment with one or two standard anti-convulsant drugs,"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9d73d435-1624-345c-b72f-db207b805662",
                                        "entry_id": "533dad95-3bd0-37ac-8d11-88207c0f1e2c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Incapable of registering a reaction or stimulus."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ca957fcf-db2c-4477-9693-7898eee5fe66",
                                                "sense_id": "9d73d435-1624-345c-b72f-db207b805662",
                                                "text": "The production of a generator potential leaves a refractory state in the receptor membrane […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "75f3f727-71a6-4cc3-a647-990404f86471",
                                                "sense_id": "9d73d435-1624-345c-b72f-db207b805662",
                                                "text": "The […] delivery of external stimuli […] delineates the pacemaker refractory period after the emission of a pacing stimulus and after the sensing of a spontaneous beat."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "refractory",
